        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R2412, 4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe geometric design of the 4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Air Register makes it a great choice for traditional or transitional decor. Its called Classic because of its timeless appearance. The Classic 4 Inch x 12 Inch Register with Damper made by Brass Accents is available in stunning finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and venetian bronze. The damper toggle allows you to control the airflow into the room. It is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 12 inch floor opening. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-10-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-14-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Classic 4 Inch x 12 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
