                "description": "The geometric design of the 4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Air Register makes it a great choice for traditional or transitional decor. Its called Classic because of its timeless appearance. The Classic 4 Inch x 12 Inch Register with Damper made by Brass Accents is available in stunning finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and venetian bronze. The damper toggle allows you to control the airflow into the room. It is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 12 inch floor opening.",
